    "text": "\u00d0is is seo seleste eahsalf wi\u00f0 ehw\u00e6rce & wi\u00f0 miste & wi\u00f0 penne & wi\u00f0 wyrmum & wi\u00f0 gih\u00f0um &\nGenim fefer fugean blostman & diles blostman & \u00f0unorclafran blostman & hamor wyrte blostman &\nDo \u00feonne teala mycel in \u00f0a eagan & smyra utewarde & wyrm to fyre.\n& \u00f0eos salf help wi\u00f0 \u00e6ghwylcum geswelle to \u00feicganne & to smyrianne in swa hwylcum lime swa hit\n\u00d0is m\u00e6g to eahsalfe.\nGenim geoluwne stan & salt stan & pipor & weh on w\u00e6ge & drif \u00feurh cla\u00f0 & do ealra gelice micel &\n\u00deis is afandan l\u00e6cecr\u00e6ft.\nWi\u00f0 lungenadle genim hwite harehunan & ysopo & rudan & galluc & brysewyrt & brunwyrt &\n& drinc \u00e6lce d\u00e6g f\u00e6stende neap fulne caldes & on \u00e6fen wearmes l\u00e6tst.\nHit is haluwende bote.\nWi\u00f0 fotadle & wi\u00f0 \u00feone dropan nim datulus \u00fea wyrt o\u00f0er nama titulosa, \u00fe\u00e6t is on ure ge\u00feeoda \u00fe\u00e6t\nNim \u00fees leaces heafda & dryg swi\u00f0e & nim \u00f0er of \u00feriddan healues penincges gewihte & peretreo &\n\u00deif is so\u00f0 l\u00e6c\u00e6cr\u00e6ft.\nSyle \u00fean men drincan o\u00fe \u00f0\u00e6t he hal sy.\nWi\u00f0 inno\u00fees astyrunge.\nAd vertiginem. Nim betonica & w\u00e6ll swy\u00f0e on win o\u00fe\u00fee on ald eala\u00f0 & w\u00e6sc \u00fe\u00e6t heafod mid \u00feam\nEft wi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t ilce nim sauina & betonica & wermod & merc & seo\u00f0 on win o\u00f0\u00f0e on o\u00f0er w\u00e6t swy\u00f0e &\n& nim si\u00f0\u00f0on \u00fea wyrtas w\u00e6rma alla wi\u00f0utan sauina & bind to \u00feam heafde alla niht.\nAd pectoris dolorem. Nim horsellenes rota & eft gew\u00e6xen barc & dry swy\u00f0e & mac to duste & drif\nNim si\u00f0\u00f0en \u00fe\u00e6t dust & mencg \u00fe\u00e6rto & styre swy\u00f0e tog\u00e6dera & do on box & nota \u00feenna neod sig.\nEft wi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t ilce nim readstalede harhuna & ysopo & stemp & do on \u00e6nne neowna pott an flering of\n& nota 